      "extract": "It is well known that if one wishes to extend the energy domain of $\\chi$PT resonances must be include as active degrees of freedom. The idea of constructing chiral Lagrangians with resonances fields was pioneered in Ref. [@EGPR], but the inclusion of tensor sources was first considered in Ref. [@CMinprogress]. For a consistent introduction of tensor sources one has to consider spin--one resonances of",
