      ],
      "extract": "We have included tensor sources in the $\\chi$PT formalism and explicitly constructed the $\\mathcal{O}(p^4)$ and $\\mathcal{O}(p^6)$ Lagrangians. The challenging part of this construction is to find a complete and non--redundant set of operators. For the reduction of the basis we have followed standard procedures. We have demonstrated that there is no odd--intrinsic--parity sector with tensor sources at the",
